# JAWS: Home > NBA > --- Statistics --- > Enter (StatisticsChoiceDialog) > Escape > Alt+Tab away and back >
# Escape to home > Alt+Tab away and back. The stray text is that dialog's first label, whose accessible
# name is "NBA Statistics Selection" (scores.py StatisticsChoiceDialog).
w 0.5
t NBA
w 3
k {ENTER}
w 14
t ---
w 4
e Statistics
k {ENTER}
w 6
e Statistics Type List
k {ESC}
w 6
e! Statistics Selection
k %{TAB}
w 5
e Notepad
k %{TAB}
w 7
e! Statistics Selection
k {ESC}
w 7
e! Statistics Selection
k %{TAB}
w 5
k %{TAB}
w 7
e! Statistics Selection
